## 🎨 Tailwind-First Styling

### **Template Styling**

**MANDATORY**: Use Tailwind classes directly in templates, NOT custom CSS classes.

```html
<!-- ✅ CORRECT - Tailwind classes in template -->
<div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-unops-md p-unops-lg bg-unops-surface-primary rounded-unops-md shadow-unops-sm border border-unops-neutral-light">
  <button class="bg-unops-primary text-white px-unops-lg py-unops-sm rounded-unops-md hover:bg-unops-primary-light transition-colors duration-200">
    {{ text() }}
  </button>
</div>

<!-- Conditional classes -->
<div [class]="containerClasses()" 
     [ngClass]="{
       'opacity-50': disabled(),
       'cursor-not-allowed': disabled(),
       'cursor-pointer': !disabled() && clickable(),
       'shadow-lg': elevated(),
       'w-full': fluid(),
       'w-auto': !fluid()
     }">
```

### **Computed CSS Classes Pattern**

Use computed signals for complex class logic:

```typescript
readonly containerClasses = computed(() => {
  const classes = [
    'relative',
    'flex',
    'items-center',
    'justify-center',
    'transition-all',
    'duration-200'
  ];
  
  // Size classes
  switch (this.size()) {
    case 'small':
      classes.push('px-unops-sm', 'py-unops-xs', 'text-unops-sm');
      break;
    case 'large':
      classes.push('px-unops-xl', 'py-unops-lg', 'text-unops-lg');
      break;
    default:
      classes.push('px-unops-md', 'py-unops-sm', 'text-unops-base');
  }
  
  // State classes
  if (this.disabled()) {
    classes.push('opacity-50', 'cursor-not-allowed', 'pointer-events-none');
  }
  
  if (this.variant() === 'primary') {
    classes.push('bg-unops-primary', 'text-white', 'hover:bg-unops-primary-light');
  }
  
  return classes.join(' ');
});
```

### **SCSS Only for Complex Patterns**

Use SCSS sparingly, only for patterns that can't be achieved with Tailwind:

```scss
// ✅ CORRECT - Complex pseudo-elements
.component::after {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  right: 0;
  top: 50%;
  transform: translateY(-50%);
  width: 3px;
  height: 24px;
  background-color: var(--unops-primary);
}

// ✅ CORRECT - Custom animations
@keyframes component-slide-in {
  from { transform: translateX(-100%); }
  to { transform: translateX(0); }
}

// ✅ CORRECT - Browser-specific styling
.component::-webkit-scrollbar {
  width: 6px;
  background: rgba(var(--unops-neutral-grey), 0.1);
}

// ❌ INCORRECT - Use Tailwind classes instead
.my-component {
  display: flex;
  background-color: var(--unops-primary);
  padding: var(--unops-spacing-md);
  border-radius: 8px;
}
```

