## 🏷️ Floating Labels with Form Controls

### **PrimeNG Float Label Pattern**

**MANDATORY**: Use `p-floatlabel` with `variant="on"` for all form inputs and dropdowns in the application.

### **Float Label with Text Inputs**

```html
<!-- ✅ CORRECT - Text input with floating label -->
<p-floatlabel variant="on">
  <input
    pInputText
    id="name"
    formControlName="name"
    class="w-full"
    [disabled]="isSubmitting()"
  />
  <label for="name">{{ 'label.name' | translate }} *</label>
</p-floatlabel>
```

### **Float Label with Dropdowns (p-select)**

**CRITICAL**: When using `p-select` with `p-floatlabel`, **DO NOT** include a `placeholder` attribute. The floating label handles both the placeholder and label functionality.

```html
<!-- ✅ CORRECT - Dropdown with floating label (NO placeholder) -->
<p-floatlabel variant="on">
  <p-select
    id="fundingOpportunity"
    formControlName="fundingOpportunityId"
    [options]="eligibleFundingOpportunities()"
    optionLabel="name"
    optionValue="id"
    [filter]="true"
    filterBy="name,referenceNumber"
    [disabled]="isSubmitting()"
    class="w-full"
  />
  <label for="fundingOpportunity">{{ 'title.fundingOpportunity' | translate }} *</label>
</p-floatlabel>

<!-- ❌ WRONG - Dropdown with placeholder causes label overlap -->
<p-floatlabel variant="on">
  <p-select
    id="fundingOpportunity"
    formControlName="fundingOpportunityId"
    [options]="eligibleFundingOpportunities()"
    optionLabel="name"
    optionValue="id"
    [placeholder]="'label.fundingOpportunity.select' | translate"  <!-- ❌ Remove this -->
    class="w-full"
  />
  <label for="fundingOpportunity">{{ 'title.fundingOpportunity' | translate }} *</label>
</p-floatlabel>
```

### **Float Label Behavior**

1. **Initial State (Empty)**: Label appears inside the field at normal position
2. **Focused State**: Label animates up and becomes smaller
3. **Filled State**: Label remains in the elevated position
4. **Required Fields**: Add asterisk (*) to the label text for required fields

### **Common Float Label Patterns**

```html
<!-- Text Input -->
<div class="mb-6">
  <p-floatlabel variant="on">
    <input
      pInputText
      id="email"
      formControlName="email"
      class="w-full"
    />
    <label for="email">{{ 'label.email' | translate }} *</label>
  </p-floatlabel>
  @if (formGroup.get('email')?.invalid && formGroup.get('email')?.touched) {
    <p-message severity="error" variant="simple" styleClass="mt-2">
      {{ 'message.validation.emailRequired' | translate }}
